_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"記·檀弓：孔子謂爲明器者，知喪道矣，備物而不可用也。其曰明器，神明之也，何取於輝煥乎！","note_content_jianti_auto":"记·檀弓：孔子谓为明器者，知丧道矣，备物而不可用也。其曰明器，神明之也，何取于辉焕乎！","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"c55afbe2-db0e-11ef-8e98-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"餤，于廉翻，又徒甘翻。飼，祥吏翻。体，蒲本翻。体夫，轝柩之夫也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"餤，于廉翻，又徒甘翻。饲，祥吏翻。体，蒲本翻。体夫，轝柩之夫也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"c55afbe5-db0e-11ef-bb19-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"歎百年曲，歷敍人自少而壯，自壯而老，少時娟好，壯時追歡極樂，老時衰颯之狀；其聲悽切，感動人心。惋，烏貫翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"叹百年曲，历敍人自少而壮，自壮而老，少时娟好，壮时追欢极乐，老时衰飒之状；其声凄切，感动人心。惋，乌贯翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"c55afbe6-db0e-11ef-b2ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":849,"link_death_year":870,"link_td_description":"同昌公主，唐朝公主，父亲是唐懿宗李漼，为郭淑妃所生。","link_td_id":"Q10001011","link_td_number_id":552350,"people_name":"文懿公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"文懿公主","people_xingming":"同昌公主","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c55afbe9-db0e-11ef-b8f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦氏","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c55afbea-db0e-11ef-a81c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"郭淑妃，唐懿宗李漼妃嫔之一，同昌公主生母。","link_td_id":"Q10011774","link_td_number_id":1337176,"people_name":"郭淑妃","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭淑妃","people_xingming":"郭淑妃","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"c55afbeb-db0e-11ef-84e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"李可及是唐朝中后期著名的宫内伶官，官至威卫将军。","link_td_id":"Q10022515","link_td_number_id":7785577,"people_name":"李可及","people_name_jianti_auto":"李可及","people_xingming":"李可及","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"c55afbec-db0e-11ef-b1a8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"c55afbdc-db0e-11ef-86bb-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"shī","source_anchor_text":"其首飾以絁八百匹為","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":124,"text":"絁","tongjian_id":"f1c13990-5069-508b-a9a7-4961625f814b"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，正月，辛酉，葬文懿公主。韋氏之人爭取庭祭之灰，汰其金銀。凡服玩，每物皆百二十輿，以錦繡、珠玉爲儀衞、明器，輝煥三十餘里；賜酒百斛，餅餤四十橐駝，以飼体夫。上與郭淑妃思公主不已，樂工李可及作歎百年曲，其聲悽惋，舞者數百人，發內庫雜寶爲其首飾，以絁八百匹爲地衣，舞罷，珠璣覆地。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月十四日辛酉，将文懿公主下葬。韦氏族人争相收取庭祭时焚烧祭物留下的灰烬，从中淘取金银。凡服饰珍玩，每种都用一百二十辆车装运，以锦绣、珠玉制成仪仗和随葬明器，光辉照耀三十余里；又赐给酒一百斛、四十头骆驼驮载的饼餤，供役夫食用。懿宗与郭淑妃思念公主不止，乐工李可及创作《叹百年曲》，曲声凄凉哀婉，舞者有数百人，调发内库各种珍宝作为他们的首饰，用八百匹粗绸作地毯，舞蹈结束后，珠玑落满一地。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，辛酉，葬文懿公主。韦氏之人争取庭祭之灰，汰其金银。凡服玩，每物皆百二十舆，以锦绣、珠玉为仪衞、明器，辉焕三十余里；赐酒百斛，饼餤四十橐驼，以饲体夫。上与郭淑妃思公主不已，乐工李可及作叹百年曲，其声凄惋，舞者数百人，发内库杂宝为其首饰，以𫄟八百匹为地衣，舞罢，珠玑覆地。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"。帛腐于笥，粟陈于廪，钱苔于砌。狡童何知，媚子因而自润，...","context_before":"...可遏矣。唯其积之已盈也，故以流艳懿宗之耳目，而长其侈心。","source_end_index":242,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"aa384b17-3b86-452e-906b-eaed3e594094","source_start_index":225,"source_text":"一女子子之死，而费军兴数十万人之资"}],"title":"三 宣宗尽揽利权致军帑空虚而乱"}],"id":25763,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c55afbdc-db0e-11ef-86bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"魏博留後","official_note":"魏博留後是唐代魏博節度使的臨時代理職務，通常由節度使去世或離任時任命，負責管理地方軍政事務，直至朝廷正式任命新節度使。在《資治通鑑》此處，韓君雄被任命為此職，顯示其在魏博地區的過渡權力。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"魏博留後","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"d4f0a329-1534-49dd-946a-63850aa686ea"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"節度使","official_note":"節度使是唐代中後期的地方軍政長官，掌管一鎮的軍隊和行政事務，權力較大，常導致藩鎮割據。在《資治通鑑》此處，韓君雄從留後被正式任命為節度使，標誌著其權力的正式確立。","official_rank":"高級地方長官","source_snippet":"節度使","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"f0aab8eb-7574-401d-b4fc-2019c2ec9282"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":814,"link_death_year":875,"link_td_description":"韩允中，或作韩允忠，本名韩君雄，赐名允中，唐朝将领，在一次兵变中控制了魏博镇并成为其节度使，实质独立于朝廷。","link_td_id":"Q10002721","link_td_number_id":1522714,"people_name":"韓君雄","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩君雄","people_xingming":"韩君雄","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c55afbef-db0e-11ef-ba6e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏博","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏博","place_note":"总部设魏州【河北省大名县】","resolved_place_entity_id":287,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c55afbf0-db0e-11ef-8fc7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"2以魏博留後韓君雄爲節度使。","content_fanyi":"朝廷任命魏博留后韩君雄担任节度使。","content_jianti_auto":"2以魏博留后韩君雄为节度使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25764,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c55afbee-db0e-11ef-a388-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京兆府","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆府","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c55afbf4-db0e-11ef-ba48-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"府司，謂京兆府所司。","note_content_jianti_auto":"府司，谓京兆府所司。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"c55afbf3-db0e-1